      "c-c104ac709a689e22": {
        "fuente": {
          "entradaId": "freeman-204",
          "modulo": "freeman-manners-customs"
        },
        "texto": "This was a humane law designed to protect the poor man from the intrusion of the money lender. “ The strict laws regulating Oriental intercourse sufficiently guard the harems of all but the very poor. When the money lender goes to any respectable house he never rudely enters, but…",
