      "c-cbcb4eb721527c60": {
        "fuente": {
          "entradaId": "freeman-206",
          "modulo": "freeman-manners-customs"
        },
        "texto": "This refers to one of the modes of gathering olives still practiced in the East, that is, by beating the branches with sticks. It was mercifully ordered that the Israelites should give the trees but one beating, leaving for the poor gleaners all the fruit that did not by this mea…",
